      "writtenOn": "2022-12-09T14:43:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. What about moving this policy check logic in the HeadsetService.setActiveDevice()?\n\n2. ActiveDeviceManager looks written by expecting setHfpActiveDevice will be always succeed. We need to check whether it works correctly when setHfpActiveDevice fails.",
