      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T03:54:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "HeadsetService.setActiveDevice doesn\u0027t check what is the purpose of setting it active. But we need to check different audio policies for different times. That\u0027s why we cannot put it in the HeadsetService. \nSince HeadsetService.setActiveDevice is invoked from ActiveDeviceManager.setHfpActiveDevice during connecting, ConnectingAudioPolicy needs to be checked before trying to make it active.",
