      },
      "lineNbr": 55,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869660
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T03:54:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently it has call audio and in band ringing features but we are leaving a backdoor to add more features for later. For example, the next use case of this class will be in BLE Audio. Thus the naming.",
      "parentUuid": "2d90e864_c805e5b3",
