      "writtenOn": "2022-12-09T14:43:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. What does \"remote\" stands for? and what will be \"local\"?\n\n2. Will STATUS_UNKNOWN be the same with NOT_SUPPORTED?\n\n3. What about CALL_POLICY_SUPPORTED and CALL_POLICY_NOT_SUPPORT?",
