      "writtenOn": "2022-12-12T03:54:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. REMOTE is the AG device here. local would be HF but this feature only consists of sending HF devices\u0027 policies to the remote/AG.\n2. They should be separated. This feature extraction or initialization is not a part of the SLC establishment of HFP. So, it needs to be set after that. There is a split second when AudioPolicy feature is not initialized but it will soon be in a moment. Thus the Unknown state.\n3. For the naming, if the HF has the code, it supports. We are curious about whether the AG is supported or not. Thus the name contains \"REMOTE\". Also, since the Audio Policy feature would be used by APIs from BluetoothDevice, they are not generic to hfp only. These values can later be used with those cases too.",
      "parentUuid": "4beb6f94_9a84b329",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 88,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 88,
